		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『Ｆー００の
様子が　おかしいっ！▽
オマエ　何を　したんだっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
