		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>助手『こらっ！　Ｆー００！！
私の　言うことを　きけっ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
