				Time="2011-10-22T08:49:37" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『待て……
Ｆー００を……　返せ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-22T08:49:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
